---
---
<section class="services-section" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header animate-fadeUp">
      <div class="chip">📦 Our Services</div>
      <h2>Complete Moving Solutions</h2>
      <p>From packing a single room to relocating entire offices — PackersHub does it all with precision.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card animate-fadeUp">
        <div class="s-icon">🏠</div>
        <div class="s-name">Household Shifting</div>
        <div class="s-desc">Complete door-to-door home relocation. Professional packing, loading, transport, unloading & unpacking.</div>
        <div class="s-price">Starting ₹3,999 →</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card animate-fadeUp" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="s-icon">🏢</div>
        <div class="s-name">Office Relocation</div>
        <div class="s-desc">Minimal business downtime. We shift your entire office infrastructure — furniture, IT, files — with precision.</div>
        <div class="s-price">Custom Quote →</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card animate-fadeUp" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="s-icon">🚗</div>
        <div class="s-name">Car Transport</div>
        <div class="s-desc">Enclosed carrier transport for your vehicle. GPS tracked, fully insured, delivered showroom-fresh.</div>
        <div class="s-price">Starting ₹5,999 →</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card animate-fadeUp" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
        <div class="s-icon">🏍</div>
        <div class="s-name">Bike Transport</div>
        <div class="s-desc">Safe two-wheeler transport with custom wooden crating. Delivered in exactly the same condition.</div>
        <div class="s-price">Starting ₹1,999 →</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card animate-fadeUp" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
        <div class="s-icon">📦</div>
        <div class="s-name">Packing Services</div>
        <div class="s-desc">Professional packing-only service. Premium materials — bubble wrap, stretch film, wooden crates.</div>
        <div class="s-price">Starting ₹999 →</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card animate-fadeUp" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
        <div class="s-icon">🏭</div>
        <div class="s-name">Storage Solutions</div>
        <div class="s-desc">Climate-controlled, CCTV-secured warehouses. Short-term or long-term with complete insurance.</div>
        <div class="s-price">Starting ₹2,999/mo →</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-section { background: var(--bg-section); padding: 80px 0; }
  .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .section-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 38px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-top: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .section-header p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 12px auto 0;
  }
  
  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .service-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 32px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .service-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  .s-icon { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .s-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .s-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .s-price {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
